{"page":{"id":"dad58df4-1ddd-4f96-94f3-4885352bf42d","theme":"pathfinder","slug":"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea","title":"Inner Sea region","meta_title":"Inner Sea region (Pathfinder) — Location, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Inner Sea region is Golarion's political and cultural center, where Andoran, Cheliax, Taldor, and Absalom shape Age of Lost Omens events. Related pages:…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Heart of <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\" class=\"entity-link\">Golarion</a> around the Inner Sea.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Golarion</strong></a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/absalom\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Absalom</strong></a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/cheliax\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Cheliax</strong></a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/andoran\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Andoran</strong></a> and <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/age-of-lost-omens\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Age of Lost Omens</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Inner Sea region connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Location:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\" class=\"entity-link\">Golarion</a>\n            — The Inner Sea lies at <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\" class=\"entity-link\">Golarion</a>&#039;s heart.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Location:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/absalom\" class=\"entity-link\">Absalom</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/absalom\" class=\"entity-link\">Absalom</a> dominates the Inner Sea.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Location:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/cheliax\" class=\"entity-link\">Cheliax</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/cheliax\" class=\"entity-link\">Cheliax</a> is an Inner Sea power.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Location:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/andoran\" class=\"entity-link\">Andoran</a>\n            — <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/andoran\" class=\"entity-link\">Andoran</a> borders the Inner Sea.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Concept:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/age-of-lost-omens\" class=\"entity-link\">Age of Lost Omens</a>\n            — Inner Sea region&#039;s entry mentions <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/age-of-lost-omens\" class=\"entity-link\">Age of Lost Omens</a> — Current <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\" class=\"entity-link\">Golarion</a> era after prophecy fails.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Contains</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">3</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/absalom\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Contains\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Absalom</strong>\n                    <span>City at the center of the world.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/cheliax\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Contains\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Cheliax</strong>\n                    <span>Infernal empire of devils and contracts.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/andoran\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Contains\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Andoran</strong>\n                    <span>Democratic nation of liberty.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Contains\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/absalom\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Absalom\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Absalom dominates the Inner Sea.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Contains\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/cheliax\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Cheliax\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Cheliax is an Inner Sea power.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Contains\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/andoran\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Andoran\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Andoran borders the Inner Sea.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Located In</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Located In\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Golarion</strong>\n                    <span>Primary world of Pathfinder.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Located In\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Golarion\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The Inner Sea lies at Golarion&#039;s heart.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/age-of-lost-omens\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Age of Lost Omens\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Inner Sea region and Age of Lost Omens appear together in mapped lore.</p>\n\n                    <p>Inner Sea region&#039;s entry mentions Age of Lost Omens — Current Golarion era after prophecy fails.</p>\n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Inner Sea region is also referenced as Inner Sea.</li><li>The Inner Sea lies at Golarion&#039;s heart.</li><li>Absalom dominates the Inner Sea.</li><li>Cheliax is an Inner Sea power.</li><li>Andoran borders the Inner Sea.</li><li>Evidence around Inner Sea region is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Inner Sea region?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        The Inner Sea region is <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion\" class=\"entity-link\">Golarion</a>&#039;s political and cultural center, where <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/andoran\" class=\"entity-link\">Andoran</a>, <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/cheliax\" class=\"entity-link\">Cheliax</a>, Taldor, and <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/inner-sea/absalom\" class=\"entity-link\">Absalom</a> shape <a href=\"/pathfinder/golarion/age-of-lost-omens\" class=\"entity-link\">Age of Lost Omens</a> events.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        Inner Sea.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":320,"uniqueness_score":"0.5620"},"entity":{"id":"408979be-0e0b-4b45-9d7a-deeb0aae5fac","name":"Inner Sea region","slug":"inner-sea","type":"place","kind":"location","type_label":"Location","short_description":"Heart of Golarion around the Inner Sea.","description":"The Inner Sea region is Golarion's political and cultural center, where Andoran, Chelia